{"step_index":171,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T21:19:00Z","input_tokens":2574,"cache_read_tokens":136614,"output_tokens":2030,"thinking":"The code includes a button with an `onclick` event that appears unnecessary. Removing this event handler is the initial step. Examining the HTML structure, the \"Load Default\" button is present and appears to be unused. Therefore, the \"Load Default\" button will be removed to declutter the user interface.\n\n\nThe \"save-btn\" text will be updated to \"Save to Quiz.\"  An options button will be added as a side icon that triggers an edge panel. The HTML and CSS for the new side button were constructed to ensure its positioning and styling are correct.\n\n\nA side panel, styled with a shadow and transition, is designed to smoothly slide in from the right when the options icon is tapped. An overlay is implemented to dim the background and prevent interaction with the main content while the panel is open. The JavaScript code handles the opening and closing transitions triggered by the options button, close button, and overlay click.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":"70","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\Desktop\\\\Exploit\\\\teacher.html\"","StartLine":"15"}}]}
